# production

/public/*

# The standalone school dashboards (/school/dashboard, /school/navigator-dashboard)
# ship their behaviour as static assets that the page fetches at runtime, so these
# have to be committed. They were previously only ever present in build output, which
# a rebuild wipes — leaving both pages with dead role tabs and no charts.
!/public/career-navigator-school-dashboard.js
!/public/career-navigator-school-navigator-dashboard.js

